flowchart TD
    Source["<b>Our repo: the source, written once</b><br/><b>bot-profiles/</b> the bot side<br/><b>playbooks/</b> YAML workflows, prompt templates and rules.md, run by <b>tools/maestro-play</b><br/><b>skills/</b> the user's own skills · <b>skills/use.yaml</b> which ones get named and installed<br/><b>docs/runner.md</b> per harness: skill paths, launch flags, permission syntax<br/><b>docs/design/project-setup.md</b> the setup template<br/><b>evals/</b> golden tasks per playbook"]

    BotRuntime["<b>Bot runtime</b><br/>Gets the bot side only<br/>Nothing bot-side goes into their repo"]

    Install["<b>Install</b><br/>1 Detect which harnesses are installed and logged in<br/>2 Write environment.md<br/>3 Copy the skills use.yaml lists under prompts and commands,<br/>for those harnesses only; with none listed, nothing<br/>4 Onboarding playbook drafts project-setup.md<br/>5 Start at the cautious, propose-only trust level<br/><i>Stops and reports if any target file already exists</i>"]

    subgraph Repo ["Their repo after install"]
        subgraph Ours ["Our footprint: namespaced and removable"]
            direction LR
            O2["<b>.maestro/project/</b><br/>project-setup.md · memory<br/><i>Committed. Theirs to keep</i>"] ~~~ O3["<b>.maestro/local/</b> environment.md<br/><b>.git/maestro/</b> tickets, usage, logs, run state,<br/>scratch files, worktrees, memory inbox, STOP<br/><i>Never committed</i>"] ~~~ O4["<b>The skills use.yaml lists</b><br/>.claude/skills/&lt;name&gt;<br/>.agents/skills/&lt;name&gt;<br/>Hidden by .git/info/exclude<br/>Prompt skills load only when named ·<br/>commands only when the user calls them"] ~~~ O5["<b>.maestro/manifest.json</b><br/>Every file we created,<br/>with checksums"]
        end

        Theirs["<b>Their own setup: never edited</b><br/>AGENTS.md · CLAUDE.md · harness settings · root .gitignore ·<br/>ticket workflow and statuses · branches without the maestro/ prefix<br/><i>Their own harness sessions never see our rules: playbooks/rules.md<br/>stays in the Maestro install and goes only into our sessions' launch flags</i>"]
    end

    Plugin["<b>Where a harness supports plugins</b><br/>Ship the listed skills as a plugin instead of copies:<br/>native install, update and removal"]

    subgraph Later ["Later"]
        direction LR
        U1["<b>Update</b><br/>Replace the listed skills<br/>Never touch project/ or local/"] ~~~ U2["<b>Uninstall</b><br/>Remove exactly what the manifest lists<br/>If a file's checksum changed, ask first<br/>Offer project/ memory as keep-or-delete"]
    end

    Source -->|"bot side"| BotRuntime
    Source -->|"harness side and templates"| Install
    Install --> Ours
    Plugin -.->|"alternative to copying skills"| Ours
    Ours ~~~ Theirs
    Repo --> Later

    classDef src fill:#e6dcf5,stroke:#6a4c9c,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef step fill:#f8c4b4,stroke:#b5472b,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef ours fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef theirs fill:#ffffff,stroke:#555,color:#1a1a1a,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    classDef runtime fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#555,color:#1a1a1a
    classDef note fill:#fff3c4,stroke:#b38f00,color:#1a1a1a

    class Source src
    class Install,U1,U2 step
    class O2,O3,O4,O5 ours
    class Theirs theirs
    class BotRuntime runtime
    class Plugin note
